 "sentences": [
  {
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 4.5,
   "text": "Sam was reading under his favorite tree when the pages started to glow."
  },
  {
   "s": 5.06,
   "e": 8.14,
   "text": "Then something rose out of the book. A door."
  },
  {
   "s": 8.74,
   "e": 13.52,
   "text": "Sam didn't think twice. He jumped and he landed 10 years in the future."
  },
  {
   "s": 14.02,
   "e": 19.04,
   "text": "A helicopter came down on the lawn and outstepped. Sam, 10 years older."
  },
  {
   "s": 19.48,
   "e": 24.96,
   "text": "His own company. The house. Every dream he once wrote in that book had come true."
  },
  {
   "s": 24.96,
   "e": 30.8,
   "text": "But how? The book pulled Sam back, page by page, to where it all began."
  },
  {
   "s": 31.42,
   "e": 34.16,
   "text": "One ordinary night, Sam wrote his dream down."
  },
  {
   "s": 34.78,
   "e": 37.84,
   "text": "Build my own company. It looked impossible."
  },
  {
   "s": 38.36,
   "e": 41.46,
   "text": "He wrote it anyway. The next morning, the alarm rang."
  },
  {
   "s": 41.88,
   "e": 47.46,
   "text": "He could hit snooze and sleep till 10, or get up and give his dream one hour."
  },
  {
   "s": 47.9,
   "e": 49.84,
   "text": "So which one? He got up."
  },
  {
   "s": 50.24,
   "e": 52.04,
   "text": "That night, his phone was calling."
  },
  {
   "s": 52.84,
   "e": 56.98,
   "text": "Three hours of scrolling, or one hour of building."
  },
  {
   "s": 57.54,
   "e": 59.96,
   "text": "He picked building. And then he picked it again."
  },
  {
   "s": 60.48,
   "e": 63.02,
   "text": "And again. Every single day."
  },
  {
   "s": 63.56,
   "e": 66.84,
   "text": "But not every choice was right. His first company failed."
  },
  {
   "s": 67.42,
   "e": 70.96,
   "text": "It hurt. But it wasn't the end. It was a lesson."
  },
  {
   "s": 71.46,
   "e": 73.38,
   "text": "So he adjusted and chose again."
  },
  {
   "s": 73.92,
   "e": 77.06,
   "text": "Day 1204. His first big client."
  },
  {
   "s": 77.62,
   "e": 80.98,
   "text": "Every scene was a choice. Some split his path apart."
  },
  {
   "s": 80.98,
   "e": 85.5,
   "text": "Some brought it back together. And all of them led to the same place."
  },
  {
   "s": 86.26,
   "e": 89.04,
   "text": "Then Sam was back under the tree. Same book."
  },
  {
   "s": 89.52,
   "e": 92.56,
   "text": "The first page was blank. So he wrote it down."
  },
  {
   "s": 93.2,
   "e": 96.28,
   "text": "Sam's story started on one page. Yours can too."
  },
  {
   "s": 96.86,
   "e": 98.88,
   "text": "Write your dreams and visions in one place."
  },
  {
   "s": 99.12,
   "e": 101.92,
   "text": "Break them into small steps and document your journey."
  },
  {
   "s": 102.46,
   "e": 103.72,
   "text": "Start yours. Undeam your."
  }
 ],
